$$
\left| G_{\text{init}} + \sum_{i \in I} G_i \cdot A_{ij} \cdot x_i \right| \leq \text{Tol}_G
$$
where $G_i$ is $d_i$, $g_i$, or $v_i$ for Delta, Gamma, or Vega, respectively.

For all $i \in I$:
$$
S_i \le x_i \le L_i
$$
$$
y_i \ge x_i
$$
$$
y_i \ge -x_i
$$
$$
y_i \ge 0
$$

